# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository, regardless of what
# line ending a given checkout (Windows git with autocrlf=true, WSL,
# Linux/mac) writes into the working tree. Without this, plain `git
# status`/`git diff` shows nearly the entire tree as modified any time a
# file round-trips through a checkout that introduces CRLF, masking real
# changes in noise. See claude/testing-perf-arabic-hosting-2026-09-15.md
# in the project docs for how this was found.
* text=auto eol=lf
